WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.005
- (people chanting) Rah!

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:08.800
Rah!

00:00:12.054 --> 00:00:13.764
Rah! Rah!

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:16.016
Rah!

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:20.229
- To the wall.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:24.942
- Often, the hardest thing
in science fiction

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:26.652
is coming up
with a point of view

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:28.862
for the world
that you're creating.

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:32.741
- We spend most of our time with
our hero tribe, which is the Alkenny.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:36.453
- Baba Voss is
the leader of the tribe.

00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:37.079
- (people chanting) See!

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:40.249
- He's got a responsibility
to protect their village

00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:41.708
and his family.

00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:50.759
The tribe is a mountain tribe,
maybe 65, 75 people,

00:00:50.843 --> 00:00:53.679
somewhat isolated
from the other tribes.

00:00:53.804 --> 00:00:57.808
- Uh, as the show goes on,
we get to open up the world

00:00:57.933 --> 00:01:00.644
and see a lot of
different tribes.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:03.689
We have a plastic tribe,
we have a metal tribe,

00:01:03.814 --> 00:01:05.649
we have the rope tribe,
which is our Alkenny.

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:09.903
The world isn't just
our small, little universe.

00:01:09.987 --> 00:01:12.489
We are creating an entire world.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:14.575
(thunder crashes)

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:16.702
- Something's different.

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:21.623
These children, they have
the ability to see.

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:23.917
Now they will come for us.

00:01:25.252 --> 00:01:27.880
- If vision disappeared for 600 years,

00:01:27.963 --> 00:01:29.256
even the concept of it would be gone.

00:01:29.381 --> 00:01:31.967
There would be
no way of describing what it is,

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:33.886
and so,
for the people who don't have it,

00:01:34.011 --> 00:01:35.679
when it returns,
it's witchcraft and it's evil.

00:01:37.181 --> 00:01:39.892
- Baba Voss' tribe exists
within a larger nation

00:01:39.975 --> 00:01:42.853
called the Payan Nation
that is governed by a queen.

00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:47.274
Queen Kane's afraid
that people with vision

00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:48.483
might have a power over her,

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:51.945
and so she sends the witchfinder
out to look for the children.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:55.866
- For centuries we feared
this day would come.

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:59.870
The evil of the light once
almost destroyed the world.

00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:03.999
And now, it has returned.

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:07.920
Find the children who can see,
and bring them to me.

00:02:09.046 --> 00:02:10.631
- These two children,
their true father

00:02:10.756 --> 00:02:13.842
is kind of a mythical figure
named Jerlamarel.

00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:19.223
- These children are a gift.
They will bring knowledge.

00:02:19.348 --> 00:02:20.933
They will begin a new world.

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:24.937
- They're the first humans
that have been able to see

00:02:25.062 --> 00:02:26.647
in hundreds and hundreds of years.

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:29.024
So, together,
they have to protect the children.

00:02:30.192 --> 00:02:32.194
- I have to keep you safe.

00:02:36.532 --> 00:02:39.076
- I have been looking for you...

00:02:40.118 --> 00:02:42.037
...for a lifetime.

00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:46.458
(shouting)

00:02:47.084 --> 00:02:47.876
(shouts)

